E. coli
BL21 (DE3) cells transformed with this vector were grown in LB medium supplemented with ampicillin (50 µg/mL; Sigma A9518) and protein expression was induced with 0.5 mM isopropyl β-D-1-thiogalactopyranoside (IPTG) (Sigma 16758) at an OD of 0.5, after which the cells were grown at 20 °C overnight. Cells were harvested by centrifugation (7000×
g
